---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy Policy for mgks.dev">
    
    <section class="page-hero">
        <h1 class="hero-title">Privacy<span class="text-accent">.</span></h1>
    </section>

    <div class="container pb-12">
        <article class="prose" style="margin-bottom: 6rem;">
            <p>Last updated: September 7, 2026</p>

            <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
            <p>
                This Privacy Policy describes how <strong>mgks.dev</strong> handles information when you visit this website. The goal is minimal data collection and full transparency about what is collected and why.
            </p>

            <h2>2. Information Collected</h2>
            <p>
                No personal data such as name, email, or address is collected unless explicitly provided (e.g., by sending an email directly).
            </p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Usage Data:</strong> Anonymous analytics may be used to understand how pages are accessed and used — including browser type, pages visited, time of visit, and similar diagnostic data. This data is aggregate and cannot be used to identify any individual.</li>
                <li><strong>Theme Preference:</strong> Light/dark mode preference is stored in your browser's local storage and never transmitted.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>3. Cookies</h2>
            <p>
                Cookies are used minimally — only to retain preferences such as theme selection.
            </p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Preference Cookies:</strong> Used to remember your light or dark mode setting.</li>
                <li><strong>Third-party Embeds:</strong> Features like Giscus comments may set their own cookies. These are governed by their respective privacy policies.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>
                You can instruct your browser to refuse all cookies. Some features (like theme persistence) may not function correctly if cookies are disabled.
            </p>

            <h2>4. Third-Party Links</h2>
            <p>
                This site links to external services (e.g., GitHub, YouTube, Substack). Once you leave mgks.dev, their privacy policies apply.
            </p>

            <h2>5. Contact</h2>
            <p>
                Questions about this Privacy Policy can be sent to: <a href="mailto:hello@mgks.dev">hello@mgks.dev</a>.
            </p>
        </article>
    </div>
</Layout>